-- src:14822 | 715.241 Despite sections 715.231 to 715.233, the court may allow or require an accused who is in custody and who has access to legal advice to appear by videoconference in any proceeding referred to in those sections, other than a part in which the evidence of a witness is taken.
@ref s 715.241 (src:14822-14822)
GIVEN `the accused is in custody` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the accused has access to legal advice` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the proceeding is a proceeding referred to in sections 715.231 to 715.233` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the part of the proceeding is a part in which the evidence of a witness is taken` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 715.241 the court may allow or require an accused to appear by videoconference` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`the accused is in custody` AND `the accused has access to legal advice`)
        THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "an accused who is in custody and who has access to legal advice"
        IF NOT `the proceeding is a proceeding referred to in sections 715.231 to 715.233`
        THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in any proceeding referred to in those sections"
        IF `the part of the proceeding is a part in which the evidence of a witness is taken`
        THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "other than a part in which the evidence of a witness is taken"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- src:14824 | 715.242 Despite anything in this Act, before allowing an accused or offender who does not have access to legal advice during the proceedings to appear by audioconference or videoconference, the court must be satisfied that they will be able to understand the proceedings and that any decisions made by them during the proceedings will be voluntary.
@ref s 715.242 (src:14824-14824)
GIVEN `the court is about to allow an accused or offender to appear by audioconference or videoconference` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the accused or offender does not have access to legal advice during the proceedings` IS A BOOLEAN
