    `s 715.25(2)(d) the suitability of the location from where the participant will participate`
    `s 715.25(2)(e) the accused's right to a fair and public hearing`
    `s 715.25(2)(f) the nature and seriousness of the offence`
    `s 715.25(2) another circumstance`

